cherrytree-docmodel (1.6.3+docmodel8-1) plucky; urgency=low

  * rich table: cell horizontal alignment (left/center/right) toolbar actions, fully undo/redo-able
  * rich table: fix paste alignment — widgets from right-aligned cells no longer inherit cell alignment in main buffer
  * rich table: fix undo image size — PNG images now restore their manually-set display size on undo
  * node undo/redo: node add, delete, move, and edit-properties are now undoable operations
  * node undo/redo: fix node delete corrupting its sibling in the DB on save
  * node undo/redo: fix redo failure after node operations
  * node undo/redo: hardened against edge cases and DB save failures
  * undo/redo UI: dropdown is now scrollable
  * undo/redo UI: descriptions now use [Node ID] Operation format
  * undo/redo UI: dropdown auto-dismisses on outside click or app focus loss; max height increased to 600
  * UI: table dialogs rename Width/Height to Min Width/Min Height; statusbar now shows node ID

